abstract: >-
  Reproducible analysis pipeline for the WATCH-DM study — a retrospective
  cohort study of diabetes mellitus patients. Contains two modules:
  (1) statistical analysis (descriptive statistics, survival analysis,
  predictive modeling) and (2) visualization (publication figures).
